---
interface ApiRow {
	owner: string;
	methods: string;
	purpose: string;
	params: string;
}

interface Props {
	sdk: 'dart' | 'typescript' | 'java' | 'swift' | 'objective-c';
	locale?: string;
}

const { sdk, locale = 'root' } = Astro.props;
const isChinese = locale === 'zh-hans' || locale === 'zh-hant';
const t = {
	title: isChinese ? '方法与命令清单' : 'Methods and Commands',
	intro: isChinese
		? '下面列出这个语言 SDK 中常用且对接方需要理解的公开入口。构建器方法会生成对应打印机指令；是否能在某台机器上使用，仍以机器固件支持的 ESC、TSPL、CPCL 或 Lin8inch 指令组为准。'
		: 'The tables below list the public entry points integration teams usually need. Builder methods generate printer commands; actual availability still depends on the ESC, TSPL, CPCL, or Lin8inch command family supported by the target firmware.',
	core: isChinese ? 'Core、连接与写入' : 'Core, Connection, and Writing',
	commands: isChinese ? '指令构建器' : 'Command Builders',
	responses: isChinese ? '回包解析' : 'Response Parsing',
	owner: isChinese ? '对象' : 'Object',
	methods: isChinese ? '方法 / 命令' : 'Method / Command',
	purpose: isChinese ? '作用' : 'Purpose',
	params: isChinese ? '参数说明' : 'Parameters',
